 block?","choices":["a small wallet","a pruned node","block relay sending short transaction ids","a tiny block"],"answer":2,"source":"BIP-152"},{"id":"L3-020","level":"intermediate","q":"What are compact block filters?","choices":["spam filters","filters letting light clients find their transactions","miner filters","email filters"],"answer":1,"source":"BIP-157, BIP-158"},{"id":"L3-021","level":"intermediate","q":"What is gossip on Lightning?","choices":["miner chat","price feeds","wallet backups","nodes sharing channel updates for routing"],"answer":3,"source":"BOLT 7"},{"id":"L3-022","level":"intermediate","q":"What is an HTLC?","choices":["a hashed timelock contract routing payments","a wallet type","a mining contract","a bank loan"],"answer":0,"source":"Lightning whitepaper"},{"id":"L3-023","level":"intermediate","q":"What is a preimage?","choices":["a block preview","a wallet image","the secret whose hash locks an HTLC","a QR code"],"answer":2,"source":"BOLT 2"},{"id":"L3-024","level":"intermediate","q":"What is onion routing on Lightning?","choices":["farming rewards","layered encryption hiding the payment path","mixing coins","peeling blocks"],"answer":1,"source":"BOLT 4"},{"id":"L3-025","level":"intermediate","q":"What is a channel announcement?","choices":["a gossip message proving a channel exists","an ad for a wallet","a miner signal","a price alert"],"answer":0,"source":"BOLT 7"},{"id":"L3-026","level":"intermediate","q":"What is a funding transaction?","choices":["a miner payout","a fee refund","a wallet backup","the on-chain transaction opening a channel"],"answer":3,"source":"BOLT 2"},{"id":"L3-027","level":"intermediate","q":"What is a closing transaction?","choices":["a bank closure","an account deletion","the on-chain transaction settling a channel","a fee payment"],"answer":2,"source":"BOLT 2"},{"id":"L3-028","level":"intermediate","q":"What is a force close?","choices":["closing a wallet app","a one-sided channel close using the latest state","forcing a payment","quitting mining"],"answer":1,"source":"BOLT 5"},{"id":"L3-029","level":"intermediate","q":"What is a penalty transaction?","choices":["punishing a cheat who broadcast an old state","a late fee","a miner fine","a tax"],"answer":0,"source":"Lightning whitepaper"},{"id":"L3-030","level":"intermediate","q":"What is a watchtower?","choices":["a mining farm","a block explorer","a wallet brand","a service watching for channel cheating while you are offline"],"answer":3,"source":"lnd docs, watchtowers"},{"id":"L3-031","level":"intermediate","q":"What is MPP?","choices":["many wallets","many miners","splitting one payment across several routes","many invoices"],"answer":2,"source":"BOLT 4"}]}
